her","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父秘"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-guzhong","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line114","quote":"顧衆，字長始，吳郡吳人，驃騎將軍榮之族弟也。父秘，交州刺史，有文武才幹。衆出後伯父，早終，事伯母以孝聞。光祿硃誕器之。州辟主簿，舉秀才，除余杭、秣陵令，並不行。元帝為鎮東將軍。命為參軍。以討華軼功，封東鄉侯，辟丞相掾。秘卒，州人立衆兄壽為刺史，為州人所害，衆往交州迎喪，值杜弢之亂，崎嶇六年乃還。秘曾蒞吳興，吳興義故以衆經離寇難，共遺錢二百萬，一無所受。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line114:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line114:m0023"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-w076-guzhong-mi","subject_person_id":"jfc_0dt_42a_A","object_person_id":"jfc_0dt_42a","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父秘"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent:head","quote":"顧衆，字長始，吳郡吳人，驃騎將軍榮之族弟也。父秘，交州刺史，有文武才幹。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent:head:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent:head:m0023"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-w076r-gz-j57-mi","person_id":"jfc_0dt_42a","event_type":"death","source_term":"秘卒","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-057","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-jin076-guzhong","source_id":"s-jinshu-057-jin076-guzhong","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-057-jin076-guzhong:succ","quote":"彥卒，又以員外散騎常侍顧秘代彥。秘卒，州人逼秘子參領州事。參尋卒，參弟壽求領州，州人不聽，固求之，遂領州。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-057-jin076-guzhong:succ:m0011"}],"interpretation_note":"